The protocol table's session close: session/close ends its session's work as
if session/cancel had been sent. The agent cancels the session's running turn,
which is answered with the cancelled stop reason, before its handler runs; a
close the agent answers with success answers the client's pending
session/request_permission for that session with the cancelled outcome
(0019-PLAN-behaviour-fixes.md, B4).

